{
  "id": "moon",
  "name": "Moon",
  "description": "Our heavenly moon: tonight's real phase and its place among the zodiac constellations, then its month unfolding \u2014 the terminator sweeping the maria and craters, earthshine on the dark limb, a slow libration \u2014 over a still lake that holds its reflection. Owls and geese cross the disc, meteors fall, and a caption names the phase with a thought for it.",
  "author": "Luci Evol - www.evoldigitalproductions.com",
